%% TRIP-016 Deleted aircraft still looks in use
%% The page never decides whether a class or add-on is in use; the server does.
flowchart TD
    A[Administrator presses the trash] --> B["Är du säker? (R2)"]
    B -- Nej --> A
    B -- Ja --> C[Server action in a transaction]
    C --> D{Used by an aircraft or a booking now? R1}
    D -- no --> E[Row deleted, page refreshed]
    D -- yes --> F["Du kan ej ta bort + the server's reason"]
